# Per-application cover letters and supplements stay OFF this PUBLIC repo.
# They name every company applied to, and seven of them discuss OPT and visa
# status -- a candidate controls when that is disclosed, and git history cannot
# really be withdrawn. The resumes are fine to publish: they name no employer.
applications/*/cover_letter_*
applications/*/*_supplement.*

# Project notes unsafe for a public repo: teammates' names and splits, contested
# authorship, interview caveats, retracted phrases. content/bank/projects/ is the
# public half; see CLAUDE.md.
content/bank/private/
